": "concept", "title": "Terminal value"}], "description": "Equity value reflects claims on uncertain future cash flows."}, {"id": "48b6e9e1-0dc5-4033-9805-9287bc3847a6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Growth and profitability", "children": [{"id": "e3f47003-0b28-4ceb-b6c8-a4deae9af963", "type": "concept", "title": "Retention and payout"}, {"id": "9405cf88-ed26-44cc-bd1d-7b6912880c1a", "type": "concept", "title": "ROE and sustainable growth"}, {"id": "b9dddcc6-a7c7-49bb-915d-8fbd50010e23", "type": "concept", "title": "Competitive advantage period"}], "description": "Good valuation separates growth that creates value from growth that consumes capital."}, {"id": "d6de31fe-e930-4e6e-8d09-807a08e8c097", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Relative valuation", "children": [{"id": "b8f42032-efce-4695-9685-2fe3dbb4174b", "type": "concept", "title": "P/E, EV/EBITDA, and price/book"}, {"id": "76af5222-6e9b-4aa8-a404-d565a81c719d", "type": "concept", "title": "Peer selection"}, {"id": "72f63563-d7c2-4c52-9022-2b240a272806", "type": "concept", "title": "Multiple drivers and normalization"}], "description": "Students learn when market multiples are useful and when they mislead."}]}, {"id": "cf9e8b77-cf67-4518-930e-5113e53dbbd0", "type": "topic", "title": "Risk and Return Measurement", "description": "Students quantify historical and expected return, volatility, downside risk, and risk premia.", "children": [{"id": "c7791161-fedc-4db9-a46c-362a6f71cd39", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Return measurement", "children": [{"id": "63d0ada7-619e-4162-8de3-6160d7251410", "type": "concept", "title": "Arithmetic and geometric returns"}, {"id": "ec543b8b-a72d-4d64-8948-ae4b484903f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Holding-period return"}, {"id": "0da25460-8d55-4d40-9137-88293e403ce2", "type": "concept", "title": "Real versus nominal return"}], "description": "Students calculate returns consistently across assets and periods."}, {"id": "a6a9d2b1-aed4-401d-83ea-a436715ddd60", "type": "subtopic", "titl