079b", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence quality and backtests"}], "description": "Students learn to evaluate claims using data, costs, taxes, and incentives."}]}, {"id": "f2d68698-f973-43c5-9995-5e9d28784280", "type": "topic", "title": "Cost of Capital and Capital Structure Introduction", "description": "Students learn how firms estimate required returns and choose between debt, equity, and internal financing.", "children": [{"id": "871f0d1d-c057-4b1b-a3b7-1cf341797453", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cost of capital", "children": [{"id": "9a542e11-e714-472f-9ec7-188c6aebe0ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost of equity"}, {"id": "e652eb89-90af-4cb8-8546-12b127ebac27", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost of debt"}, {"id": "29e47bcd-cdaa-46a0-a94f-d0ec057c0664", "type": "concept", "title": "WACC"}], "description": "The cost of capital is the opportunity cost for project and firm valuation."}, {"id": "c5152d60-743c-409e-afe7-8353ba98f230", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capital structure", "children": [{"id": "c205deb1-e1b8-43c2-88c7-57ff9d358e18", "type": "concept", "title": "Debt versus equity"}, {"id": "84863d28-7bdd-432e-b3bc-48a58094afd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Tax shields"}, {"id": "96fd6f76-7497-43cc-96ed-76bbc28e5a71", "type": "concept", "title": "Financial distress costs"}], "description": "Students learn why financing mix can matter through taxes, distress, and agency costs."}, {"id": "1aa7b5a9-833b-44fb-abf6-cb75de630894", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Financing lifecycle", "children": [{"id": "5b876c07-a0a6-4d31-b703-38eed136f2c9", "type": "concept", "title": "Internal financing"}, {"id": "c25d8883-48b0-48d8-a383-484dffc27d68", "type": "concept", "title": "Bank debt and bonds"}, {"id": "62829925-6e8d-4d94-86c3-bfcbb5721416", "type": "concept", "title": "Public equity and private capital"}], "description": "Different firms use different financing at different stages."}]}, {"id": "830c29a6-5088-4635-b5dc-e3de91909a2e", "type": "topic", "title": "Capital Budgeting and Corporate Investment Decisions", "description": "This topic teaches the NPV-centered toolkit for deciding whether projects create value.", "children": [{"id": "13244677-1e6b-47ac-ba26-603bf986e8af", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Decision rules", "children": [{"id": "07af8856-ff3c-4a2d-a7de-e494b32e6a78", "type": "concept", "title": "NPV"}, {"id": "7c614e93-ebfe-40ff-b988-8e69b9c561bd", "type": "concept", "title": "IRR and MIRR"}, {"id": "824d29b0-74fa-4669-a174-0a1d4a9ea103", "type": "concept", "title": "Payback and profitability index"}], "description": "Students learn which project rules create value and which can mislead."}, {"id": "af2f9760-bdbf-43ae-8134-f80998ac84f1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cash-flow estimation", "children": [{"id": "9c12a3d4-9a00-45f5-9716-520d10851392", "type": "concept", "title": "Sunk costs"}, {"id": "7ac29e8d-aafc-498c-8e75-1bff7a158e2e", "type": "concept", "title": "Opportunity costs"}, {"id": "c317932c-e169-40db-93f7-ac1593f4f368", "type": "concept", "title": "Taxes, depreciation, and working capital"}], "description": "Project evaluation depends on incremental cash flows."}, {"id": "288a6b6f-ea85-4e6a-b04d-b6db3ed5174e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project risk", "children": [{"id": "c19184ac-1203-4af8-bc3c-dc6ec28970d8", "type": "concept", "title": "Sensitivity and scenario analysis"}, {"id": "b6c35d12-6891-4e57-84eb-71f9d88abbc5", "type": "concept", "title": "Break-even analysis"}, {"id": "4bd25206-7205-4b58-902f-a3b8b8c5520a", "type": "concept", "title": "Real options preview"}], "description": "Capital budgeting must account for uncertainty and strategic flexibility."}]}, {"id": "2a279991-0759-40c7-9610-680f5b207730", "type": "topic", "title": "Working Capital, Payout Policy, Governance, and Agency Problems", "description": "Students connect short-term financial management and governance to value creation and stakeholder trust.", "children": [{"id": "d5d934ff-d6cf-4375-a8ec-00682ef820db", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Working capital", "children": [{"id": "e1f42799-fc42-4f35-9bab-d9afcc76357c", "type": "concept", "title": "Cash conversion cycle"}, {"id": "04c502b9-4fc0-4835-867d-9ffc6cecd7a1", "type": "concept", "title": "Receivables and inventory"}, {"id": "7de214fc-8192-489a-ab00-874feaf62f47", "type": "concept", "title": "Payables and liquidity tradeoffs"}], "description": "Short-term financial management affects liquidity and operating resilience."}, {"id": "25ce3dc4-5250-4715-b8e1-9b0797009580", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Payout policy", "children": [{"id": "a627a7a4-8870-4de7-bd99-fa16ba46e65f", "type": "concept", "title": "Dividends"}, {"id": "9ffc5a92-0581-428a-a89b-9582420d552d", "type": "concept", "title": "Share repurchases"}, {"id": "ed44a312-a236-4215-b097-05e5d1a0f389", "type": "concept", "title": "Payout signaling"}], "description": "Firms return cash through dividends and repurchases when reinvestment opportunities are limited."}, {"id": "6c5b87f8-ea5e-4237-a488-26d090877f6c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Governance and agency", "children": [{"id": "307075ea-c396-4a1b-a0b9-486c907bac05", "type": "concept", "title": "Agency costs"}, {"id": "20f3b9b6-0d22-466a-ac8b-43e5f9379a22", "type": "concept", "title": "Board oversight"}, {"id": "973f18f0-2a6e-46b0-809d-110476d350df", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive incentives"}], "description": "Finance studies conflicts among managers, shareholders, creditors, and stakeholders."}]}, {"id": "3b4187b3-36f2-45ae-b761-9e78ad34c5e9", "type": "topic", "title": "Risk Management, Derivatives, Insurance, and International Finance Basics", "description": "This module introduces tools firms and investors use to manage market, credit, operational, and foreign-exchange risks.", "children": [{"id": "331c3cb9-cbfb-409e-8afc-6526509f011e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Risk management process", "children": [{"id": "3df7439f-f527-4bc8-8cca-c2df4c23166c", "type": "concept", "title": "Market, credit, liquidity, and operational risk"}, {"id": "e0c51252-7065-4a6e-8109-ab575b111c38", "type": "concept", "title": "Hedging versus speculation"}, {"id": "a61d2250-6ee5-4168-9207-8700d7c8babc", "type": "concept", "title": "Enterprise risk management"}], "description": "Students learn to identify, measure, and decide which risks to retain, reduce, or transfer."}, {"id": "b719dce3-0bca-47e3-a57e-6fdcbbcd5aa4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Derivative basics", "children": [{"id": "c8fd4d45-6b88-466b-a97a-403d05ece93d", "type": "concept", "title": "Forwards and futures"}, {"id": "0c7d074c-db2c-4b46-96f1-dac46c3a72e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Options"}, {"id": "6cb602dc-b6ee-452d-8a5d-5dfcc99ee7bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Swaps"}], "description": "Derivatives can reshape risk when used responsibly."}, {"id": "63099512-8b34-4aae-8cb8-93a401398ba6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "International finance", "children": [{"id": "2d9c79e1-ed4b-4bc9-8259-789597edfc7d", "type": "concept", "title": "FX markets"}, {"id": "6ced6f3b-c15f-443a-b77f-4594b5b7a58f", "type": "concept", "title": "Purchasing power and interest parity intuition"}, {"id": "72078bf0-f246-40f9-aa06-51d1f07d56ef", "type": "concept", "title": "Country risk"}], "description": "Global finance adds exchange-rate, country, and inflation risks."}]}, {"id": "f9a36132-a963-4407-898a-35c29cb2c072", "type": "topic", "title": "Fintech, Sustainable Finance, Ethics, and Professional Standards", "description": "Students consider how finance is changing through technology, sustainability, regulation, and professional responsibility.", "children": [{"id": "07e6cde0-bd63-4806-b8ff-3c081fe57fdc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fintech", "children": [{"id": "3b6165e3-99a7-4b74-a8f4-fb49090e006b", "type": "concept", "title": "Digital payments"}, {"id": "6e58a8ed-b4c7-423f-a674-2c2856ea258d", "type": "concept", "title": "Robo-advice"}, {"id": "1b548fb2-a7e5-41f2-8516-986a33a41ee7", "type": "concept", "title": "Blockchain and tokenization basics"}], "description": "Technology changes payments, lending, investing, and risk measurement."}, {"id": "ac710d23-364d-45a8-865c-70d58f68fce1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainable finance", "children": [{"id": "941d3653-be15-4394-b66a-a1971294a432", "type": "concept", "title": "ESG data quality"}, {"id": "4e4c698e-2b4d-4874-8f39-4a472d57c3d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Climate transition risk"}, {"id": "6ed38cc1-db72-46b0-85d9-3d9ce622e332", "type": "concept", "title": "Green bonds and impact investing"}], "description": "Students learn how ESG, climate risk, and stakeholder concerns enter financial decisions."}, {"id": "e8057ec5-c843-4e63-a55b-63c5f3293433", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethics and standards", "children": [{"id": "e67be536-1d8c-4505-a1f6-429d6b7731e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest"}, {"id": "a73144d0-8f8f-4e9a-ae4a-ac1074783970", "type": "concept", "title": "Fiduciary duty"}, {"id": "6e10cfbc-dd18-4b9f-b0ef-0db620e31622", "type": "concept", "title": "CFA-style ethics principles"}], "description": "Financial decisions require trust, disclosure, and professional conduct."}]}, {"id": "2e6de657-476b-4330-889e-eb58186b44ae", "type": "topic", "title": "Finance Decision Capstone", "description": "The course culminates in a full finance analysis that combines markets, valuation, risk, capital budgeting, and communication.", "children": [{"id": "18d9e060-0108-41a5-9d23-55a270abedfc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Case selection", "children": [{"id": "99c18c20-da63-4a22-82c0-53331b20123a", "type": "concept", "title": "Company or project background"}, {"id": "e4d5a0e8-ecf5-44ce-b66c-b2f072600e4d", "type": "concept", "title": "Market and industry context"}, {"id": "a5e317af-26fc-42dc-a865-60eeeb0880ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Decision question"}], "description": "The capstone integrates finance tools around a real firm, project, or portfolio decision."}, {"id": "80c945c8-be0f-4d0b-b668-3a3953eee6c7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Analysis package", "children": [{"id": "0f0da218-4628-41ab-ac74-aca3aed3703e", "type": "concept", "title": "TVM and capital budgeting"}, {"id": "44bb6d71-b56e-42a9-b573-e2166cd7ff12", "type": "concept", "title": "Security valuation"}, {"id": "e82ef92e-01bb-476b-a500-96a30a9afec8", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk-return and cost of capital"}], "description": "Students combine valuation, risk, and financing logic."}, {"id": "e84e8461-51fb-47d5-9d24-328330675369", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Communication", "children": [{"id": "ee432f33-6ff0-4cb0-a732-44b459f477bc", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive memo"}, {"id": "05289f3a-5a92-4d07-ba99-fab8bdd8a757", "type": "concept", "title": "Tables and exhibits"}, {"id": "8d5ff6fb-9cc8-4eed-9f23-a838adacea41", "type": "concept", "title": "Recommendation and limitations"}], "description": "Finance work matters only when it can be defended to decision makers."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$fofjson$::jsonb,
