ics"}], "description": "Technology changes payments, lending, investing, and risk measurement."}, {"id": "ac710d23-364d-45a8-865c-70d58f68fce1", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainable finance", "children": [{"id": "941d3653-be15-4394-b66a-a1971294a432", "type": "concept", "title": "ESG data quality"}, {"id": "4e4c698e-2b4d-4874-8f39-4a472d57c3d5", "type": "concept", "title": "Climate transition risk"}, {"id": "6ed38cc1-db72-46b0-85d9-3d9ce622e332", "type": "concept", "title": "Green bonds and impact investing"}], "description": "Students learn how ESG, climate risk, and stakeholder concerns enter financial decisions."}, {"id": "e8057ec5-c843-4e63-a55b-63c5f3293433", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Ethics and standards", "children": [{"id": "e67be536-1d8c-4505-a1f6-429d6b7731e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest"}, {"id": "a73144d0-8f8f-4e9a-ae4a-ac1074783970", "type": "concept", "title": "Fiduciary duty"}, {"id": "6e10cfbc-dd18-4b9f-b0ef-0db620e31622", "type": "concept", "title": "CFA-style ethics principles"}], "description": "Financial decisions require trust, disclosure, and professional conduct."}]}, {"id": "2e6de657-476b-4330-889e-eb58186b44ae", "type": "topic", "title": "Finance Decision Capstone", "description": "The course culminates in a full finance analysis that combines markets, valuation, risk, capital budgeting, and communication.", "children": [{"id": "18d9e060-0108-41a5-9d23-55a270abedfc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Case selection", "children": [{"id": "99c18c20-da63-4a22-82c0-53331b20123a", "type": "concept", "title": "Company or project background"}, {"id": "e4d5a0e8-ecf5-44ce-b66c-b2f072600e4d", "type": "concept", "title": "Market and industry context"}, {"id": "a5e317af-26fc-42dc-a865-60eeeb0880ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Decision question"}], "description": "The capstone integrates finance tools around a real firm, project, or portfolio decision."}, {"id": "80c945c8-be0f-4d0b-b668-3a3953eee6c7", "type": "subtopic", "t